  "Question": "A road is being repaired. \\(\\frac{2}{5}\\) of it has been repaired, covering 8 kilometers. How many kilometers long is the entire road? Calculate: \\(8 \\div (\\frac{2}{5}) = ?\\)",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "20",
