  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "For the supplied quotient, divide by the nonzero fraction \\(\\frac{2}{5}\\) by multiplying by its reciprocal, \\(\\frac{5}{2}\\):\n\\[\n8 \\div \\frac{2}{5} = 8 \\times \\frac{5}{2} = \\frac{40}{2} = 20.\n\\]\nThe entire road is \\(20\\) kilometers long.",
